hem.\nThey also play zone coverage at the 10th-highest rate and two-high safety at the third-highest rate. That should set up well for McMillan, who leads the Panthers in targets per route run and yards per route run against those coverages.\nPick: Tetairoa McMillan Anytime Touchdown (+180, DraftKings)\nDarren Waller Anytime Touchdown (+400)\nDarren Waller is healthy and not on the injury report entering tonight's game, which is great news after he scored a 50-yard touchdown on National Tight Ends Day.\nWaller is second on the Panthers in end-zone targets behind McMillan. The veteran tight end doesn’t get a ton of volume, but his role is consistent as a big target for Bryce Young in the end zone.\nI think the Panthers may have to throw a lot in this game in a trailing game script, and Waller sets up well to get another score.\nPick: Darren Waller Anytime Touchdown (+400, DraftKings)\nRelated Articles\nFree Guide: 10 Tips to Hit Bigger Same Game Parlays More Often\n10 real, data-backed strategies for SGP bettors. Just enter your email and we'll send it.\nAbout the Author\nGilles Gallant is a sports betting expert at the Action Network, specializing in NFL Anytime Touchdown Scorer props. A regular contributor to The Action Network Podcast and YouTube shows like Action Island and Bet What Happens Live, Gilles has been betting on the NFL since 2012 and honed his profitable strategy in 2018. With a background at Odds Shark and FTN Network, he’s known for his expertise in NFL and other sports markets like NBA and MLB. Gilles holds a degree in broadcast journalism from Nova Scotia Community College and is a Certified Sales Professional.​\nThis site contains commercial content . We may be compensated for the links provided on this page. The content on this page is for informational purposes only. Action Network makes no representation or warranty as to the accuracy of the information given or the outcome of any game or event.\nTop Stories\nNFL\nPanthers vs Packers Predictio