 his ankle in last Sunday’s win over the Packers.\nThere’s been no indication that the Lions expect to be without either player against the Vikings this week and the rest of the week’s practices should provide more information on their condition.\nCornerback Ennis Rakestraw (ankle), safety Kerby Joseph (knee), and running back Jacob Saylors (neck) were limited participants. Defensive tackle Tyliek Williams missed practice with an illness while defensive end Aidan Hutchinson, defensive tackle Alim McNeill, left tackle Penei Sewell, and defensive end DJ Wonnum took rest days.\nClose Ad\nAdd favorite players, teams, and leagues with an NBCUniversal Profile\nContinue","revision_hash":null},{"source":"Pro Football Talk","source_type":"analytical","url":"https://www.nbcsports.com/nfl/profootballtalk/rumor-mill/news/jakobi-meyers-limited-in-jaguars-practice-antonio-johnson-out","canonical_url":"https://www.nbcsports.com/nfl/profootballtalk/rumor-mill/news/jakobi-meyers-limited-in-jaguars-practice-antonio-johnson-out","url_hash":"e4439c77973b3c3d73a9ed5a28b1b5c990ee453bc15d3d10ada6ddbe328618e5","content_hash":"0ea1a0a568fa306dff8fa28532ad607bb4ae1e514aed85e93d9acc5348ae7113","title":"Jakobi Meyers limited in Jaguars practice, Antonio Johnson out","summary":"The Jaguars are coming off a bye week and their return to practice featured a few limited participants.","published_at":"2026-10-28T20:25:07.000Z","confidence":0.66,"author":"Josh Alper","captured_at":"2026-10-29T14:59:12.476Z","body":"Jakobi Meyers limited in Jaguars practice, Antonio Johnson out - NBC Sports\nSkip navigation\nPro Football Talk\nRumor Mill\nPFT Video\nPFT PM\nPFT Live\nPFT Clips\nPFT Draft: Best matchups of Week 8\nWhy questions swirl around Lamar’s health\nCoen trying to keep Jaguars focused vs. Colts\nOther PFT Content\nChristian Watson, Matthew Golden are delivering for the Packers\nMike Florio ,\nMike Florio ,\nKirk Cousins is having a rare debut run with the Raiders\nMike Florio ,\nMike Florio ,\nD