isualCol\":1,\"prop\":1}],[],[]] []\nWeek 8 NFL Games Time\nPanthers @ Packers Thursday Night Football\nRavens @ Bills Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\nVikings @ Lions Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\nFalcons @ Buccaneers Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\nColts @ Jaguars Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\nTitans @ Bengals Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\nCardinals @ Cowboys Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\nRaiders @ Jets Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\nBrowns @ Steelers Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\nChargers @ Rams Sunday -- 4:05 p.m. ET\nChiefs @ Broncos Sunday -- 4:25 p.m. ET\nPatriots @ Dolphins Sunday -- 4:25 p.m. ET\nEagles @ Commanders Sunday Night Football\nBears @ Seahawks Monday Night Football","revision_hash":null},{"source":"Sharp Football","source_type":"analytical","url":"https://www.sharpfootballanalysis.com/fantasy/the-worksheet/","canonical_url":"https://www.sharpfootballanalysis.com/fantasy/the-worksheet/","url_hash":"52fb56b635e5d41dd85eea3fac4e112e9e1f24208ec0d5965d88a715898df65e","content_hash":"561617bb4214d77662105913fd10aa10dea071ad695b890e67a09ecfe81ba886","title":"The Worksheet: Week 8 NFL Fantasy Football Game Previews","summary":"Welcome to Week 8 of The Worksheet, Rich Hribar's comprehensive fantasy football preview. What is The Worksheet? The Worksheet is a comprehensive weekly fantasy football preview for each NFL game. Rich Hribar analyzes matchups for every notable fantasy player in every game, every week of the NFL season. We are officially in Week [...]","published_at":"2026-10-28T13:00:37.000Z","confidence":0.69,"author":"Rich Hribar","captured_at":"2026-10-29T14:59:12.476Z","body":"The Worksheet: Week 8 NFL Fantasy Football Game Previews\nBy Rich Hribar | 2026-10-28T09:57:16-04:00 Oct 28, 2026 |\nView Larger Image\nWelcome to Week 8 of The Worksheet, Rich Hribar's comprehensive fantasy football preview.\nWhat is The Worksheet?\nThe Worksheet is a comprehensive weekly fantasy football preview for each NFL game. Rich Hribar analyzes matchups for every notable fantasy player in every game, every week of the NFL season.\n[[[\"Sharp Football Fantasy Articles\"],[\" Fantasy Cheat Sheet \"],[\" The Worksheet Game Previews \"],[\" Fantasy Football Rankings \"],[\" Waiver Wire Pickups \"],[\" DFS Picks: DraftKings & FanDuel \"],[\" Live Fantasy Football Q&A With Rich Hribar \"],[\" Implied Team Totals \"],[\" Expected Fantasy Points Tool \"],[\" Expected Fantasy Points Allowed \"],[\" Red Zone Usage \"],[\" IR Tracker \"],[\" NFL Odds & Picks \"],[\" NFL Prop Odds & Picks \"]],[{\"row\":0,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":0,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0},{\"row\":1,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":1,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":2,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":2,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":3,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":3,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":4,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":4,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":5,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":5,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":6,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":6,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":7,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":7,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":8,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":8,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":9,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":9,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":10,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":10,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":11,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":11,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":12,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":12,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}},{\"row\":13,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":13,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"}}],[],[]] []\nSharp Football Fantasy Articles\nFantasy Cheat Sheet\nThe Worksheet Game Previews\nFantasy Football Rankings\nWaiver Wire Pickups\nDFS Picks: DraftKings & FanDuel\nLive Fantasy Football Q&A With Rich Hribar\nImplied Team Totals\nExpected Fantasy Points Tool\nExpected Fantasy Points Allowed\nRed Zone Usage\nIR Tracker\nNFL Odds & Picks\nNFL Prop Odds & Picks\nWe are officially in Week 8 and heading downhill for the fantasy regular season in most leagues.\nThis season has already been a war of attrition.\nWeek 7 was an odd one for the league.\nOffenses set season highs in yards per play (5.6) and third-down conversion rate (43.7%).\nWe also had a season-high 2.32 points per possession and 26.5% touchdown rate per drive.\nBut scoring (22.3 offensive points per game) was the third-lowest-scoring week of the season.\nOffenses averaged a season-low 9.6 possessions per game.\nAs a result, Week 7 was the third-lowest-scoring fantasy week of the year.\nThe good news is that fewer overall possessions meant fewer penalties.\nThe 6.3 penalties and 50.8 penalty yards per game were the fewest for any week this season.\nWe don't have an international game this week, so this is as \"normal\" a week as we've had since the season's opening month in terms of the slate.\nWe do have another four teams on bye.\nThe Texans, 49ers, Saints, and Giants are off this week.\nPaired with injuries, rosters will be thinned out this weekend.\nThis article will be updated throughout the week to reflect major news or injury implications.\nI encourage you to use the game-by-game tables and data points here, along with  the  player rankings available every Wednesday .\nEnjoy the games!\nClick the matchups below for the individual game previews.\nWeek 8 Fantasy Football Matchups\n[[[\"Week 8 NFL Games\",\"Time\"],[\" Panthers @ Packers \",\"Thursday Night Football\"],[\" Ravens @ Bills \",\"Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\"],[\" Vikings @ Lions \",\"Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\"],[\" Falcons @ Buccaneers \",\"Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\"],[\" Colts @ Jaguars \",\"Sunday -- 1 p.m. ET\"